: false, "body": "I'm interested in a coloured sketch sheet of my DnD character. He is a victorian doctor who is also a werewolf.\nHe has black hair that's tied in a low ponytail with some grey hairs due to his age. His facial hair is also black and grey. He has green eyes and pale skin with some dark lines under his eyes. He has a monocle that he wears around his neck so he can easily bring it up to his eye to read. \nHis wolf form is black and grey like his hair, his ponytail remains in his wolf form as well as his facial hair that appears in the fur of his face. I'm interested in one coloured sketch of his human form and one of his full werewolf form with another rough non-coloured sketch of his face semi transformed showing his shoulders so we can see a large wolf bite on his left shoulder. \nI've attached a link to some references. I included one of yours that I feel captures what I'd like his human body shape to look like.\nPlease let me know if the amount sent is not sufficient, thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1La7jw4odN2FlIudphEFbOuQR3ivKpbYb?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marimoyasya/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ed8c830/uploads/origins/ddc5d235-89ed-49a7-bde6-5b0ea70ac760?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17bd3367869c29e3a4efdcde7e717859", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ed8c830/uploads/origins/ddc5d235-89ed-49a7-bde6-5b0ea70ac760?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17bd3367869c29e3a4efdcde7e717859, https://si.imgix.net/4ed8c830/uploads/origins/ddc5d235-89ed-49a7-bde6-5b0ea70ac760?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21bdf7b0b0366d0e039cdcc1e9401274 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ed8c830/uploads/origins/ddc5d235-89ed-49a7-bde6-5b0ea70ac760?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bba0b29e8c4fd22038998b74260d3253 3